1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Twenty years before the Second World War,

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,530
Germany was not allowed a single tank.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:10,030
The Treaty of Versailles had limited the army to 100,000 men,

4
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,470
an air force and U-boats were banned,

5
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:16,338
and the country was to pay billions in reparations.

6
00:00:16,358 --> 00:00:18,245
Then the money collapsed.

7
00:00:18,265 --> 00:00:23,405
In 1923 a loaf of bread in Berlin cost hundreds of billions of marks,

8
00:00:23,595 --> 00:00:27,365
and a lifetime of savings was worthless overnight.

9
00:00:27,434 --> 00:00:31,054
The country had barely recovered when the Great Depression struck,

10
00:00:31,074 --> 00:00:35,693
and by 1932 six million Germans were out of work.

11
00:00:35,713 --> 00:00:42,105
In this situation, on 30 January 1933, Adolf Hitler became Chancellor.

12
00:00:42,125 --> 00:00:45,145
Within a few months his government

13
00:00:45,165 --> 00:00:48,877
eliminated the parties, the trade unions and the free press.

14
00:00:48,897 --> 00:00:53,611
At the same time Germany rearmed, first in secret, then openly.

15
00:00:53,631 --> 00:00:57,001
In 1935 conscription returned,

16
00:00:57,021 --> 00:01:00,039
and the Luftwaffe was officially unveiled.

17
00:01:00,059 --> 00:01:04,979
In 1936 soldiers marched into the demilitarised Rhineland,

18
00:01:04,999 --> 00:01:06,864
and nobody stopped them.

19
00:01:06,884 --> 00:01:10,824
In 1938 came Austria and the Sudetenland,

20
00:01:10,844 --> 00:01:15,061
in March 1939 the rest of Czechoslovakia.

21
00:01:15,081 --> 00:01:17,931
Each time, Britain and France hoped

22
00:01:17,951 --> 00:01:19,476
it would be the last step.

23
00:01:19,496 --> 00:01:24,346
On 1 September 1939 at 4:45 a.m.

24
00:01:24,366 --> 00:01:27,166
the battleship Schleswig-Holstein

25
00:01:27,186 --> 00:01:29,968
opened fire on the Westerplatte near Danzig.

26
00:01:29,988 --> 00:01:34,814
Two days later Britain and France declared war on Germany.

27
00:01:34,834 --> 00:01:36,614
It would last six years

28
00:01:36,634 --> 00:01:40,444
and cost more than sixty million people their lives.
